<title>UK: ABN AMR0 sets warrants on basket of 15 Dutch firms.</title>
<headline>ABN AMR0 sets warrants on basket of 15 Dutch firms.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Bank N.V. said it has issued one million American-style call warrants, on a basket of 15 Dutch companies.</p>
<p>The basket includes Aegon, Ahold, Baan, CSM, Elsevier, Getronics, Hagemeyer, Heineken, IHC Caland, Nutrica, Oce, Polygram, Randstad, VNU and Wolters Kluwer.</p>
<p>One basket is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    11799 NLG		 PREMIUM	=</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     16.70 NLG		 GEARING	7.1 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.JAN.97-04.DEC.98   PAYDATE	06.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   AMSTERDAM		 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  11799 NLG</p>
<p> --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
